132	///
133	/// Design choice (option (b) hand-written, per the step prompt):
134	/// the autograd tape's structure -- nodes, parent ids, op
135	/// kinds -- stays exactly as the CPU tape built it. After the
136	/// forward pass, this helper walks node ids in insertion order
137	/// (which is topological because each op's parents are pushed
